bold italic sans: 𝙏𝙝𝙚 𝙌𝙪𝙞𝙘𝙠 𝘽𝙧𝙤𝙬𝙣 𝙁𝙤𝙭 𝙅𝙪𝙢𝙥𝙚𝙙 𝙊𝙫𝙚𝙧 𝙩𝙝𝙚 𝙡𝙖𝙯𝙮 𝙙𝙤𝙜.
italics serif: 𝑇ℎ𝑒 𝑄𝑢𝑖𝑐𝑘 𝐵𝑟𝑜𝑤𝑛 𝐹𝑜𝑥 𝐽𝑢𝑚𝑝𝑒𝑑 𝑂𝑣𝑒𝑟 𝑡ℎ𝑒 𝑙𝑎𝑧𝑦 𝑑𝑜𝑔.

The block kit code should be valid block kit code.
When you generate the block kit code: 
- Add several sections. 
- Include the name of the property, [Provide:{PROPERTY NAME}], and explain the characteristics of the house, such as [Provide:{BATHS}], [Provide:{BEDS}] and [Provide:{ASKING PRICE}]. 
- Include a the picture of the property, which image_url is [Provide:{PICTURE}]. 
- Include a button which url points to https://d1q000001ewauuaq-dev-ed.develop.lightning.force.com/[Provide:{RECORD ID}]
- Include emoticons so the post is more visual.

Example of block kit code:

{
