        {
            &quot;type&quot;: &quot;section&quot;,
            &quot;text&quot;: {
                &quot;type&quot;: &quot;mrkdwn&quot;,
                &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Hello, Assistant to the Regional Manager Dwight! *Michael Scott* wants to know where you&#39;d like to take the Paper Company investors to dinner tonight.&#92;n&#92;n *Please select a restaurant:*&quot;
